# CODEOWNERS — Phase 277.B.109
#
# Every subsystem must have >=1 primary owner + >=1 secondary owner.
# GitHub auto-assigns reviewers from this file on every PR touching
# the listed paths.  Last-order-wins: a later rule overrides an
# earlier one for the same path.
#
# Owners are GitHub usernames under the organisation that owns this
# repository (cardosop). Team aliases are added here once the
# organisation provisions them — until then the owner username is the
# fallback so review assignment actually resolves.
#
# Reference: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

